              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Option 2:"
            },
            {
              "_key": "zhgisixn9n3o",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " For a more budget-friendly route, opt for microbuses departing from Midan al-Remaya near the Pyramids of "
